wait 0.6
log letters
type aA1 
log controls
key ctrl+a ctrl+c ctrl+z ctrl+[ ctrl+\\ ctrl+space
log editing
key return tab shift+tab esc backspace delete
log arrows
key up down left right shift+up ctrl+right opt+left
log nav
key home end pgup pgdn
log fn
key f1 f2 f5 f12 shift+f5
log modified
key shift+return ctrl+return opt+return
log option
key opt+b opt+f opt+d
log punctuation
type ~!@#$%^&*()_+{}|:"<>?
wait 0.3
shot i-keys-legacy.png
